      "primary_message": "Combine all ingredients except club soda and lemon zest in a mixing glass and fill with ice. Stir well until chilled, about 30 seconds. Strain into a chilled cocktail glass or small highball glass. Top with club soda; twist lemon zest over drink and use as garnish.",
